QuestGuidance.Register("en",156,{
[4961]="7002724D\n1\tScout the path to the Rohirrim scout-camp\tAndreg has asked you to help him scout the Gravenwood -- specifically the path to the Rohirrim scout-camp -- for signs of Gwyllion's passage.\n2\tTalk to Andreg\tAndreg is preparing to part company with you. You should speak with him to find out where to go from here. Completing this quest will make it impossible to acquire new discoverables from Andreg and will fail the Tracking an Old Goat deed and any unresolved discoverables.\n",
[4962]="7002C954\n1\tAndreg has asked you to help him scout the South Gravenwood -- specifically the path to the Rohirrim scout-camp -- for signs of Gwyllion's passage.\t\n2\tTalk to Andreg\tAndreg is preparing to part company with you. You should speak with him to find out where to go from here.\n",
[4963]="7006F08F\n1\tDefeat Ekhamâti scouts (total: 5)\tTalmûri informed you that farmers in the area have spotted Ekhamâti scouts hiding in the marshes nearby. She asked that you stop them before they can bring information back to the enemy.\n2\tReturn to Talmûri in Burukíri\tReturn to Talmûri in Burukíri and let her know you have dealt with the scouts in the marshes.\n",
[4964]="7001A4A3\n1\tDefeat Darkwing spies in the Mirk-eaves (total: 8)\030Defeat Warg-scouts in the Mirk-eaves (total: 8)\tCrebain and Wargs can be found throughout the Mirk-eaves. Faroniel has asked you to blind the eyes of Dol Guldur by defeating many of the crebain and Wargs which roam the Mirk-eaves.\n2\tTalk to Faroniel at Echad Sirion\tFaroniel is at Echad Sirion in the Mirk-eaves. You should return to Faroniel with tidings of your success.\n",
[4965]="70030439\n1\tInvestigate along the road west for signs of Orc-killers\tEgelferth suspects that Orc-killers have taken up holdings near the road west and can be flushed out into the open if provoked.\n2\tInvestigate further west along the road\tEgelferth suspects that Orc-killers have taken up holdings near the road west and can be flushed out into the open if provoked.\n3\tInvestigate the sacked cart along the road to Snowbourn\tEgelferth suspects that Orc-killers have taken up holdings near the road west and can be flushed out into the open if provoked.\n4\tTalk to Egelferth\tEgelferth can be found in northern Walstow. You should return to Egelferth with news of your success.\n",
[4966]="700077F5\n1\tThe people of Staddle can be found tending and watching over their farms or in the centre of Staddle. Gammy Boggs has recommended that you speak to some of the Staddle-folk to learn what happened to Falco's garden.\t\n2\tTalk to Gammy Boggs at her farm\tGammy Boggs is on the second farm north of the road near the Staddle farms. The knowledge you gained from the people of Staddle will be of great interest to Gammy Boggs, the town gossip.\n",
[4967]="7003EB07\n1\tDefeat hendrevail in the Bruinen Gorges (total: 6)\tHendrevail can be found in the Bruinen Gorges of the Trollshaws. While you are in the Bruinen Gorges, you should deal with the hendrevail which have begun to appear there.\n",
[4968]="700272AD\n1\tTalk to Léofward at the Rohirrim scout-camp\tLéofward is at the Rohirrim scout-camp. Saeradan asked you to speak with Léofward and offer him your services.\n",
[4969]="70071779\n1\tTalk to Rhadrog\tYou should talk to Rhadrog about Nabatínu's theory that defeating Ombátha may allow the enthralled Jatsakóri to break free.\n2\tGo to the Ordâkhai stronghold of Kôth Rau\tRhadrog has asked you to scout Kôth Rau, the Ordâkhai stronghold in south-central An Shêru.\n3\tDestroy banners of Barkhûsh (total: 6)\tYou have come to Kôth Rau to scout out the situation at the Ordâkhai stronghold and found them flying the banners of Sauron, called Barkhûsh in this part of the world.\n4\tInvestigate the prisoners\tAs you destroyed banners of Barkhûsh at Kôth Rau, you noticed that they are holding prisoners here. You should assess the situation with the prisoners.\n5\tPick up the shiny object\tAs you got closer to some of the prisoners, a shiny glint of something metal on the ground caught your eye. You should pick it up.\n6\tTalk to Nabatínu at Gadim-ûn\tYou have done what you can for the moment at Kôth Rau. You should return to Gadim-ûn and discuss what you found with Nabatínu.\n",
[4970]="70050E13\n1\tLook to the west for Ungoladan activity\tLook towards the west for any Ungoladan activity.\n2\tLook to the west for Ungoladan activity\tContinue to head west and scout for Ungoladan activity.\n3\tLook to the west for Ungoladan activity\tContinue to head west and scout for Ungoladan activity.\n4\tLook to the west for Ungoladan activity\tEnter Rushgate and scout for Ungoladan activity.\n5\tTalk to Radagast\tRadagast can be found in the north of the Thornholt woods. Return to Radagast and let him know what you've seen here in Rushgate.\n",
[4971]="7000E3DB\n1\tScout Bail Dílas\tBail Dilas lies in Angmar, far to the north and east of Esteldín. Handarod has asked you to scout the encampment of Bail Dílas and see what forces are arrayed near the gates of Carn Dûm.\n2\tScout Gorthbar\tGorthbar lies in Angmar, far to the north and east of Esteldín. Handarod has asked you to scout the graveyard of Gorthbar and see what dread rites the Enemy is performing in that horrid place.\n3\tScout Minas Caul\tMinas Caul is in Angmar, far to the north and east of Esteldín. Handarod has asked you to scout the tower of Minas Caul and see what forces of the Enemy inhabit the Witch King's domain there.\n4\tTalk to Handarod\tHandarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and south of Angmar. You should report to Handarod and tell him what you have seen in the heart of Angmar.\n",
[4972]="7006EC1A\n1\tClean up the flotsam on the beach (total: 6)\tMaghôrdo has asked you to clean up any flotsam you find on the island's southern beaches so that visitors will not be reminded of the peril of travelling here.\n2\tTalk to Maghôrdo\tYou have cleaned up the flotsam from shipwrecks along the island's southern beaches. You should report to Maghôrdo at Furtherholm's harbour, near the waterfall.\n",
[4973]="70068647\n1\tEzôti can be found by Bith Gabâr in the Upper Ward.\t\n",
[4974]="700358B1\n1\tDefeat frost grims around Lake Isingmere\tIf not thinned drastically, the frost grims around Lake Isingmere will eventually pose a grave threat.\n2\tDefeat frost grims around Lake Isingmere (total: 6)\tIf not thinned drastically, the frost grims around Lake Isingmere will eventually pose a grave threat.\n3\tCompleted\tThe frost grims along the edge of Lake Isingmere have been thinned drastically and shouldn't pose much of a threat for a while.\n",
[4975]="7002EE1D\n1\tTalk to Adalmód to gain entrance to the Mead Hall of Eaworth\tAdalmód stands guard outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth. You should speak with Adalmód when you are ready to enter the Mead Hall.\n2\tTalk to Reeve Ingbert within the Mead Hall of Eaworth\tReeve Ingbert is within the Mead Hall of Eaworth. You should speak with Reeve Ingbert regarding the discussion you witnessed.\n",
[4976]="700276B1\n1\tDefeat Terror\030Defeat Panic\tDefeat Terror and Panic.\n2\tDefeat Nightmare\tDefeat Nightmare.\n",
[4977]="7006989E\n1\tTalk to Tafikh\tTafikh is waiting to ask you her first question.\n2\tQuestion One: Belondor, Kinsman of the Fleet-fast, is married to an Umbari woman named Khâsha. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n3\tTalk to Tafikh\tTafikh is waiting to ask you her second question.\n4\tQuestion Two: Azagath Sea-shadow has been known to walk through the markets of Umbar Baharbêl. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n5\tTalk to Tafikh\tTafikh is waiting to ask you her third question.\n6\tQuestion Three: The Church of the All-Seeing prized the sea-opal Abâshal, and used it to decorate its places of worship. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n7\tTalk to Tafikh\tTafikh is waiting to ask you her fourth question.\n8\tQuestion Four: The Sea-stone Mutiny, during which the Heirs of Castamir were overthrown, began in the Upper Ward of the city. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n9\tTalk to Tafikh\tTafikh is waiting to ask you her fifth question.\n10\tQuestion Five: The name of this land comes from the word Umbru-mâra, which means 'Fruitful Land.' This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n11\tTalk to Tafikh\tTafikh is amazed that you answered all of her questions correctly.\n",
[4978]="70057E6D\n1\tTravel to Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade\tAnnâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade. You should travel to Annâk-khurfu.\n2\tTalk to Léothred at Annâk-khurfu\tLéothred can be found at Annâk-khurfu. You should talk to Léothred at Annâk-khurfu.\n3\tDefeat Gundabad forces in Elderslade (total: 12)\tGundabad forces can be found throughout Elderslade. You should defeat Gundabad forces in Elderslade.\n4\tTalk to Léothred at Annâk-khurfu\tLéothred can be found at Annâk-khurfu. You should talk to Léothred at Annâk-khurfu.\n",
[4979]="7006C58B\n1\tCollect oasis seeds from the dead oasis ([see journal]/6)\030Collect oasis keepsakes from the dead oasis ([see journal]/6)\tTharashil asked you to go to the dead oasis to the north-west to collect keepsakes and dormant seeds from the oasis. They safe-keep them for the memory of those who faded.\n2\tReturn the oasis keepsakes and seeds to Tharashil at Shonith\tYou collected the oasis seeds and keepsakes. Return them to Tharashil at Shonith to show your intent to assist the Elves.\n",
[4980]="7006071A\n1\tReach the Ranger cache before Faeron\tThe first Ranger cache is located north-east of Tornhad, beyond a still pond, nestled among the rocks west of the base of a swiftly-flowing waterfall.\n2\tTalk to Faeron by the Ranger cache\tFaeron stands smugly by the first Ranger cache.\n3\tReach the Ranger cache before Faeron\tThe second Ranger cache is located just to the north, across the river, nestled in a ditch near the western cliff's edge.\n4\tRemain alert for Faeron's approach, and catch him in the act!\tFaeron might approach at any moment, but if you can catch him in the act you will win the contest.\n5\tApprehend Faeron\tFaeron thinks to sneak by your guard and collect the Ranger cache? Show him he cannot slip by you!\n6\tTalk to Faeron by the Ranger cache\tFaeron stands by the second cache, quite pleased with himself.\n7\tCollect the third Ranger cache on an island in the stream to the north-east\tThe third Ranger cache is located on an island in the stream a short distance to the north-east.\n8\tSurprise Faeron\tFaeron has not yet seen you. Now is your chance to surprise him!\n9\tCollect the Ranger cache\tThe third Ranger cache is located on a small island in the middle of the stream.\n10\tBring the contents of the Ranger cache to Mithrendan at Tornhad\tThe Ranger Mithrendan is back at Tornhad.\n",
[4981]="7000D3D2\n1\tTalk to Cána\tCána is at Fail-á-Khro, north of Aughaire. The Trév Gállorg have retaken Fail-á-Khro and now seek your assistance to hold it.\n",
[4982]="7007251B\n1\tSpeak with Rhadrog near the south-west gate in Zajâna\tValukhâri is dismissive that the tale is nothing more than a child's fable spun for a new crowd and age. Something does not sit right with you. Take the map to your allies Rhadrog and Faeron, recently arrived here in Zajâna and gather their opinions.\n2\tShare the story with Faeron at the fountain square Zajâna\tRhadrog believes the tale may have merit and wants you to share the story and map with Faeron at the fountain square in Zajâna.\n3\tAsk Rhadrog how to proceed at the south-west gate in Zajâna\tFaeron and Rhadrog agree there is a reason to investigate further. Faeron suggested you ask Rhadrog how to proceed.\n",
[4983]="700272D4\n1\tTalk to Grimbold at the Ford of Isen\tGrimbold is at the Ford of Isen. Daervunn has asked you to speak with Grimbold on his behalf.\n2\tTalk to Grimbold at the Ford of Isen\tGrimbold has outlined his suspicions about Isengard's involvement in the orders he has received. You must find some way to free the Ranger without Grimbold's direct involvement.\n",
[4984]="70012FE5\n1\tSwivel the third mirror to match the others\tThe third mirror is in the Twenty-first Hall in Zelem-melek. You should angle the third mirror to match the angles of its brethren.\n2\tReturn to Darri\tDarri can be found in the Twenty-first Hall. You should return to Darri and tell him what happened when you swivelled the mirror.\n",
[4985]="7000005B\n1\tTalk to Chief Watcher Grimbriar\tChief Watcher Grimbriar can be found at a cottage along the Greenway, north of Bree. Anlaf directed you to tell Chief Watcher Grimbriar about his supply problem in the hope that Grimbriar might help him obtain the goods he needs.\n2\tDefeat Howling Yellowfang (total: 6)\tThere are wolves in the Midgewater Pass, in the north-east corner of the Midgewater Marshes, east of Bree. Wolves in the Midgewater Pass have been causing trouble for a friend of Chief Watcher Grimbriar. Grimbriar asked you to thin the pack as a favour while he gathers supplies for Anlaf.\n3\tTalk to Chief Watcher Grimbriar\tGrimbriar awaits you at the cottage along the Greenway, north of Bree. Chief Watcher Grimbriar will want to hear of your success against the wolves of the Midgewater Pass.\n",
[4986]="70041C7C\n1\tCollect baskets in Erynos (total: 3)\030Collect cloth in Erynos (total: 3)\030Collect flowers in Erynos (total: 3)\tBaskets, flowers, and cloth can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin. Glathril has asked you to gather materials so that she might craft tribute baskets for the Sisters of Lebennin.\n2\tDeliver the materials to Glathril in Erynos\tGlathril can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin. You have gathered all the materials that Glathril requested, and you should now return them to her.\n3\tPlace a tribute basket in the Gilrain\030Bring a tribute basket to the Gilrain\030Place a tribute basket in the Serni\030Bring a tribute basket to the Serni\030Place a tribute basket in the Sirith\030Bring a tribute basket to the Sirith\tA basket can be delivered into the waters of the Gilrain to the west of Malbarth, near a waterfall along the Serni east of Ost Anglebed, and into the Sirith to the south-east of Erynos. Glathril has crafted the baskets and has asked you to deliver them into the rivers of Lebennin.\n4\tTalk to Glathril in Erynos\tGlathril can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin. You have delivered the tribute baskets into the Gilrain, Serni, and Sirith, and should now return to Glathril.\n",
[4987]="700077F6\n1\tTalk to Falco Greenhand at his farm\tFalco Greenhand's farm lies to the south-west of Gammy Boggs' farm. Gammy Boggs has suggested you speak with Falco Greenhand again and tell him of the mysterious trespassers that were seen near his garden.\n2\tTalk to Constable Bolger at his farm\tConstable Bolger's house is located south-east of Falco Greenhand's farm. Confronted with the truth, Falco Greenhand confessed that he had made an underhanded bargain with ruffians. He has asked you to speak with Constable Bolger and warn him that the brigands are coming to burn the town.\n3\tTalk to Falco Greenhand at his farm\tFalco Greenhand's farm lies to the north-west of Constable Bolger's home. You and Constable Bolger have defeated the Blackwold brigands who had planned to burn the town of Staddle. Falco will be glad that you have succeeded.\n",
[4988]="70037D63\n1\tTravel to The Party Tree\tThe Fall Festival is spreading good-hearted tricks and tasty treats across Middle-earth. Join in by starting at the Shire where Mr. Bilbo Baggins has left one last surprise for his neighbours.... Happy fall!\n2\tTravel to the Party Tree to participate in the Fall Festival\tThe Fall Festival is spreading good-hearted tricks and tasty treats across Middle-earth. Join in by starting at the Shire where Mr. Bilbo Baggins has left one last surprise for his neighbours. Happy fall!\n",
[4989]="7000258F\n1\tDefeat Rauta-lehmä Warriors (total: 4)\030Defeat Rauta-lehmä Hunters (total: 2)\tThe Earth-kin of the Rauta-lehmä faction are encamped east of Esteldín in Nan Amlug. You should show the traitorous Rauta-lehmä that they have chosen the wrong side in the coming war.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Earth-kin of the Rauta-lehmä in the eastern section of Nan Amlug.\n",
[4990]="70071603\n1\tDefeat bee guardians defending the queen (total: 2)\tSênjar has asked you to slay the new queen of the bees of Medân Makhai. Before you can face the queen, you must defeat the bee guardians defending the queen. Medân Makhai can be found north-west of Sormedân.\n2\tFind and defeat the aggressive queen bee\tFind and defeat the aggressive queen bee in Medân Makhai.\n3\tReturn to Sênjar in Sormedân\tReturn to Sênjar in Sormedân and tell him the new queen has been defeated.\n",
[4991]="700033AB\n1\tGather fallen apples (total: 6)\tThe Bag End apple orchard is just to the west of Bag End. Gaffer Gamgee has asked you to do a little gardening on his behalf by gathering the fallen apples from Bag End's orchard, certain that the Sackville-Bagginses will not chase off a Bounder.\n2\tBring the apples to Gaffer Gamgee\tGaffer Gamgee is outside his home on Bagshot Row at the foot of the Hill in Hobbiton. You should bring Gaffer Gamgee the apples you were able to salvage from the apple piles.\n",
[4992]="70028443\n1\tCollect Rohirrim helm\030Collect Rohirrim spear\030Collect Rohirrim shield\tThe personal effects of the Rohirrim scout are scattered about the area in Nan Curunír. You should collect the personal effects of the fallen Rohirrim scout.\n2\tBring the rider's effects to Dagoras at his camp in Nan Curunír\tDagoras is at his camp in Nan Curunír. You should bring the fallen rider's personal effects to Dagoras.\n",
})
